      "description": "Linux kernel headers. Userspace UAPI (Linux-syscall-note exception applies): linux/spi/spidev.h (SpiDriver), linux/ioctl.h and linux/types.h (my_spi_dev.h shared ioctl definitions). Kernel module internal headers: linux/spi/spi.h, linux/module.h, linux/miscdevice.h, linux/uaccess.h, linux/slab.h, linux/mutex.h (my_spi_driver.c). Build-time only for userspace; kernel module compiled against the running kernel's build tree."
